>**Increases nation's Supplies.**
=2 Walkthrough
* Gain your mission from {n:Hieronymus} by selecting __Resource Procurement__ from the {p:Campaign Ops|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Campaign_Op} menu.
* He will send you to the {p:Quartermaster (Bastok)|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Quartermaster_(Bastok)} located at (H-9).
* The {p:Quartermaster (Bastok)|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Quartermaster_(Bastok)} will ask you for a stack of 12 {p:Crystals|Category:Crystal}.
** The type of {p:Crystals|Category:Crystal} required are random. Having a {p:mule|Mule} at an AH is handy for this mission.
* Trade the {p:Crystals|Category:Crystal} to the {p:Quartermaster (Bastok)|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Quartermaster_(Bastok)} (H-9).
** Note: this quest does not supply any Resources.
* Report back to {n:Hieronymus} to complete the Mission.

